{"3165650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Masters of Albion", "steam_appid": 3165650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is no single solution. Only yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masters of Albion is a god game where you don’t just shape the world - you can step into it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your town, guide your people and decide how Albion survives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice has consequences, and no two paths are the same...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/cc2c933a97bad23f09cf8eda4160bd82.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1355 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/5caaac042466d04fd908aa8bc05132e1.poster.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/5caaac042466d04fd908aa8bc05132e1.webm?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/5caaac042466d04fd908aa8bc05132e1.mp4?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old Albion is gone - swept aside by the advance of modern technology.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But magic was never truly lost...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it returns, creeping back into the world, draining the life from its people and reshaping everything it touches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are chosen to wield its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Granted the abilities of a god, you must guide, protect and shape Albion as you see fit - building a world strong enough to withstand what’s coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient force is rising.<br>What you create will decide whether Albion survives it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/9aa05f83260f70d89c4ae5087a848c6e.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1355 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/0fcc086996e36de874e0548a8b494df0.poster.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/0fcc086996e36de874e0548a8b494df0.webm?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/0fcc086996e36de874e0548a8b494df0.mp4?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As a god, you shape every part of your town.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and place buildings wherever you choose.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire, house, and manage your workforce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise structures with colours, patterns and use weird designs to make them your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine building types to create unique, multi-purpose spaces using a flexible building system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there’s no waiting. No timers. No delays.<br>If you build it, it works - instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/a3480054a2abcceb005716d785f6863c.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1355 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/5a474374a827d08e33a516248c5a9a29.poster.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/5a474374a827d08e33a516248c5a9a29.webm?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/5a474374a827d08e33a516248c5a9a29.mp4?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roam freely across the world of Albion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See everything from above - or step into the lives of your people and experience it from the ground. Take control of heroes, workers, animals and more as you explore in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests, uncover hidden treasures, and venture into underground caves where danger waits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons and armour to strengthen your heroes, and prepare them for what lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From quiet moments to unexpected encounters - whether you’re exploring, fighting, or yes… kicking chickens - Albion is yours to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/16d21d74810e05c31d6367e9ce9a4497.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1355 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/44e2e13aeb527037991d72ad7bb7bf6f.poster.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/44e2e13aeb527037991d72ad7bb7bf6f.webm?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/44e2e13aeb527037991d72ad7bb7bf6f.mp4?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take control with the God Hand - and shape Albion however you choose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build entire towns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design weapons, armour, clothing and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact directly with the world and everyone in it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lift, move, throw or possess the living to take full control of their actions.<br>Reward your people - or push them to their limits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash devastating abilities when needed.<br>Strike enemies with lightning. Set the world ablaze. Crush threats with whatever is within reach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From careful guidance to outright destruction, the choice is always yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is what it means to wield real power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/732e8ce4575121b23c50bc224899499c.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1355 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/30a4844856318659f90b73e2aca1d060.poster.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/30a4844856318659f90b73e2aca1d060.webm?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/30a4844856318659f90b73e2aca1d060.mp4?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>When night falls, Albion is under threat.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creatures emerge from the dark, descending on your towns and tearing through everything in their path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the power of a god, you decide how to defend it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and arm defensive structures to hold the line.<br>Position heroes where they’re needed most.<br>Raise walls to slow the advance - or funnel enemies into carefully planned choke points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step in directly when the pressure builds.<br>Strike with lightning. Set fire to advancing hordes.<br>Grab whatever is at hand - boulders, barrels and more - and turn it against them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or take control of your heroes and face the threat head-on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every night is a test.<br>What you’ve built will only survive if you defend it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>There is no single solution. Only yours.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Masters of Albion is a god game where you don’t just shape the world - you can step into it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your town, guide your people and decide how Albion survives. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice has consequences, and no two paths are the same...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/cc2c933a97bad23f09cf8eda4160bd82.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1355 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/5caaac042466d04fd908aa8bc05132e1.poster.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/5caaac042466d04fd908aa8bc05132e1.webm?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/5caaac042466d04fd908aa8bc05132e1.mp4?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Old Albion is gone - swept aside by the advance of modern technology.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But magic was never truly lost...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now it returns, creeping back into the world, draining the life from its people and reshaping everything it touches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are chosen to wield its power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Granted the abilities of a god, you must guide, protect and shape Albion as you see fit - building a world strong enough to withstand what’s coming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient force is rising.<br>What you create will decide whether Albion survives it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/9aa05f83260f70d89c4ae5087a848c6e.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1355 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/0fcc086996e36de874e0548a8b494df0.poster.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/0fcc086996e36de874e0548a8b494df0.webm?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/0fcc086996e36de874e0548a8b494df0.mp4?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As a god, you shape every part of your town.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and place buildings wherever you choose.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire, house, and manage your workforce.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customise structures with colours, patterns and use weird designs to make them your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine building types to create unique, multi-purpose spaces using a flexible building system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there’s no waiting. No timers. No delays.<br>If you build it, it works - instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/a3480054a2abcceb005716d785f6863c.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1355 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/5a474374a827d08e33a516248c5a9a29.poster.avif?t=1777976779\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/5a474374a827d08e33a516248c5a9a29.webm?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/5a474374a827d08e33a516248c5a9a29.mp4?t=1777976779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roam freely across the world of Albion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See everything from above - or step into the lives of your people and experience it from the ground. Take control of heroes, workers, animals and more as you explore in real time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete quests, uncover hidden treasures, and venture into underground caves where danger waits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft weapons and armour to strengthen your heroes, and prepare them for what lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From quiet moments to unexpected encounters - whether you’re exploring, fighting, or yes… kicking chickens - Albion is yours to discover.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3165650/extras/16d21d74810e05c31d6367e