tors": {"ids": [5], "notes": "Masters of Albion contains adult language, whereby characters use expletives when in conversation with each other and the player.\r\n\r\nThe game contains melee and ranged combat, with the player able to take control of characters wielding swords, maces and war hammers to attack bandits and zombies. Sometimes, players will find themselves in mild peril.\r\n\r\nMasters of Albion also contains machines of war: ballistas, catapults, trebuchets, and these are used as part of a player's town defences.\r\n\r\nThe player will also find themselves coming under attack from enemies using bows and crossbows.\r\n\r\nPlayers can design their own weapons and test them out on their workers in the Testing Room, where a human character will be struck with a weapon to test its effectiveness.\r\n\r\nThe game's narrative involves a scene in which bandits capture and imprison innocent workers, and an image of a beheaded dog..\r\n\r\nIt also involves a scene where the player is able to hang a man after deciding on his guilt.\r\n\r\nNPCs will regularly visit their town's tavern as a place to socialise after a day of working, during which time they are depicted drinking. There is one scene in which one NPC is inebriated.\r\n\r\nPlayers are also able to use crude, adult hand gestures at will in the game.\r\n\r\nIn general, Masters of Albion contains adult language, graphic violence, alcohol abuse and general mature content."}, "ratings": {"dejus": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "14", "required_age": "14", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Linguagem imprópria\nViolência"}, "steam_germany": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "16", "required_age": "16", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Drastische Gewalt\nAlkohol / Tabak\nDerbe Sprache"}, "igrs": {"rating_generated": "1", "rating": "18", "required_age": "18", "banned": "0", "use_age_gate": "0", "descriptors": "Penggunaan bahasa\nKekerasan\nRokok dan/atau rokok elektronik, 